# APP REFACTOR — gates

1. Refactor artifacts use `memory-bank/app/refactor/plan/<epic_id>/` and `refactor/implement/<epic_id>/rNN-*.yaml`.
2. Preserve method/path, input/output/errors, roles and UI wire journey unless the plan explicitly changes the contract.
3. Replaced paths go into `deletes:` with an import/rg check; no compatibility shim without a follow-up epic.
4. Targeted backend + frontend + wire regressions are required before APP QA.
